# Phase 2A — design-agent LLM response cache.
#
# This directory is intentionally committed to the repository. The
# Slice 2A.4 LLM client writes one JSON file per (prompt_hash,
# schema_hash, model) tuple here, keyed by SHA-256. CI replays from
# these cached responses, so test runs do NOT need ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
#
# When the BriefAnalyst / ProgramArchitect prompts change, regenerate
# the cache locally with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set, then commit the new
# files. Stale cache files are harmless (the new prompt_hash misses
# them) but should be pruned to keep the repo size reasonable.
#
# Slice 2A.1 commits this .gitkeep so the directory exists — actual
# cache JSON files arrive with Slice 2A.5 / 2A.6.
